# Tests

- Feature + Unit. `RefreshDatabase`.
- `phpunit.xml`: sqlite `:memory:`, `QUEUE_CONNECTION=sync`, cache y sesión `array`.
- Helper: `Tests\Concerns\InteractsWithPermissions`.
- CRUD mínimo: index 200, 403, store, update, destroy, headers JSON (`draw`, `recordsTotal`, `data`).
- Correr: `docker exec php-cint php artisan test`.
